    {
      "id": "annotation_1",
      "provider": "annotation",
      "name": "Read this first",
      "config": {
        "content": "**FalkorDB**\n\nGraph Explorer opens this pipeline's graph node as a connection. Start the pipeline, then open Graph Explorer and choose the connection.\n\n**Nothing here can write.** `allow_execute` is off, so Graph Explorer browses read-only and has no write console for this node. Turn it on only for a node you trust people to change data through.\n\nTo ask questions in words, add an LLM node and connect it to this graph node. Browsing with Cypher needs no model.\n\nChange `host`, `port` and `graph` to your instance. Browsing uses `GRAPH.RO_QUERY`, which the server itself restricts to reads. Put the password in the node's form (stored encrypted; this template holds none).",
        "bgColor": "var(--rr-annotation-bg-default)",
        "fgColor": "var(--rr-text-primary)"
      },
      "ui": {
        "position": {
          "x": 480,
          "y": 100
        },
        "measured": {
          "width": 340,
          "height": 300
        },
        "nodeType": "annotation"
      }
    }
  ],
